{"title": "Trump Paused Iran Military Action Citing Diplomacy, Missile Concerns", "summary": "US President Donald Trump halted plans for military strikes against Iran approximately 13 days after they were initially considered. The decision was reportedly influenced by concerns over diplomacy and the existing missile stockpile. Trump cited these factors as reasons for pausing the escalation of military action.", "summary_points": ["US President Donald Trump paused plans for military strikes against Iran.", "The decision came about 13 days after the plans were considered.", "Diplomacy was cited as a reason for the pause.", "Concerns over the missile stockpile also influenced the decision.", "Trump stated these factors led to halting the escalation of military action."], "title_hi": "ट्रम्प ने कूटनीति, मिसाइल चिंताओं का हवाला देते हुए ईरान पर सैन्य कार्रवाई रोकी", "summary_hi": "अमेरिकी राष्ट्रपति डोनाल्ड ट्रम्प ने लगभग 13 दिनों के बाद ईरान के खिलाफ सैन्य हमलों की योजनाओं को रोक दिया। यह निर्णय कूटनीति और मौजूदा मिसाइल भंडार को लेकर चिंताओं से प्रभावित बताया गया। ट्रम्प ने सैन्य कार्रवाई को बढ़ाने में रोक लगाने के कारणों के रूप में इन कारकों का हवाला दिया।", "summary_points_hi": ["अमेरिकी राष्ट्रपति डोनाल्ड ट्रम्प ने ईरान के खिलाफ सैन्य हमलों की योजनाओं को रोक दिया।", "यह निर्णय योजनाओं पर विचार किए जाने के लगभग 13 दिनों बाद आया।", "रोक का एक कारण कूटनीति को बताया गया।", "मिसाइल भंडार को लेकर चिंताएं भी निर्णय से प्रभावित हुईं।", "ट्रम्प ने कहा कि इन कारकों के कारण सैन्य कार्रवाई को बढ़ाने में रोक लगाई गई।"], "framing": {"center": "Centrist coverage focused on the specific reasons cited by President Trump for halting military action against Iran, highlighting the diplomatic considerations and concerns about the missile stockpile.", "right": "Right-leaning coverage emphasized President Trump's decision to pause military strikes on Iran, stressing the 13-day timeline and highlighting his stated reasons of diplomacy and concerns over the missile stockpile."}, "framing_hi": {"center": "मध्यमार्गी कवरेज ने ईरान के खिलाफ सैन्य कार्रवाई रोकने के लिए राष्ट्रपति ट्रम्प द्वारा बताए गए विशिष्ट कारणों पर ध्यान केंद्रित किया, जिसमें कूटनीतिक विचार और मिसाइल भंडार को लेकर चिंताएं शामिल थीं।", "right": "दक्षिणपंथी कवरेज ने ईरान पर सैन्य हमलों को रोकने के राष्ट्रपति ट्रम्प के फैसले पर जोर दिया, 13-दिवसीय समय-सीमा पर प्रकाश डाला और कूटनीति तथा मिसाइल भंडार को लेकर चिंताओं के उनके बताए गए कारणों पर प्रकाश डाला।"}, "topic": "Politics", "region": "World", "image_url": "https://images.indianexpress.com/2026/07/iran-vs-us.gif", "sources": [{"source": "The Indian Express", "owner": "Indian Express Group", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://indianexpress.com/article/world/us-iran-conflict-donald-trump-pauses-tehran-airstrikes-patriot-missiles-hormuz-10804577", "headline": "Why Trump halted plans to escalate US military action against Iran"}, {"source": "Republic World", "owner": "Republic World", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi-_?oc=5", "headline": "Donald Trump Pauses US Strikes on Iran After 13 Days, Cites Diplomacy and Missile Stockpile Concerns: Report"}, {"source": "Al Jazeera English", "owner": "Al Jazeera English", "lean": "international", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "US and Iran hit pause on strikes for second day"}, {"source": "Al Jazeera English", "owner": "Al Jazeera English", "lean": "international", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/7/26/us-and-iran-hit-pause-on-strikes-for-second-day?traffic_source=rss", "headline": "US and Iran hit pause on strikes for second day"}, {"source": "Mint", "owner": "HT Media", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.livemint.com/news/world/irans-23-billion-oil-cushion-can-trump-s-sanctions-force-tehran-to-back-down-11785239046987.html", "headline": "Iran’s $23 billion oil cushion: Can Trump’s sanctions force Tehran to back down?"}, {"source": "Mint", "owner": "